List connections in the Foundry project.

Usage
  azd ai connection list [flags]

Flags
      --kind string : Filter by connection kind (e.g., remote-tool)

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for list
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (supported: json, table) (default "table")
  -p, --project-endpoint string : Foundry project endpoint URL (overrides env var and config)

Examples
  List all project connections
    azd ai connection list

  List remote tool connections as JSON
    azd ai connection list --kind remote-tool --output json
